He went like one that hath been stunned,  
And is of sense forlorn:  
A sadder and a wiser man,  
He rose the morrow morn.$demo$), now() - interval '57 days'
where not exists (select 1 from public.chapters where chapters.id = '00000000-0000-4000-9300-001900070000'::uuid);

